"Use <b>Refresh Terms</b> to load them for chosen models, modules\n"
"               or languages (leave empty for everything). Every translatable\n"
"               term is collected — Python, JavaScript, QWeb, fields, views and\n"
"               menus — whether already translated or not."
msgstr "Tumia <b>Onyesha Upya Maneno</b> kuyapakia kwa miundo, moduli\n               au lugha zilizochaguliwa (acha tupu kwa kila kitu). Kila neno\n               linaloweza kutafsiriwa hukusanywa — Python, JavaScript, QWeb, sehemu, mwonekano na\n               menyu — iwe tayari limetafsiriwa au la."

